{
  "story_id": "camel-and-the-well",
  "chapter": 2,
  "total_duration_ms": 347232,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "They found the well after three hours of walking.",
      "start_ms": 1333,
      "end_ms": 4362
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "It was in a small dip between two big dunes — a place Nadia would never have picked out as different from anywhere else in the whole desert, but Sidi walked straight to it.",
      "start_ms": 4362,
      "end_ms": 14843
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "The well was very old.",
      "start_ms": 14843,
      "end_ms": 16236
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "It was a small stone-lined pit about two meters across, mostly covered by a large flat piece of wood weighted with stones.",
      "start_ms": 16236,
      "end_ms": 23688
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Sidi lifted the wood.",
      "start_ms": 23688,
      "end_ms": 25020
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Beneath it was a dark shaft going down.",
      "start_ms": 25020,
      "end_ms": 27444
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "He lowered a small bucket on a rope.",
      "start_ms": 27444,
      "end_ms": 29685
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "It went down for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 29685,
      "end_ms": 31503
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Then Nadia heard a small splash.",
      "start_ms": 31503,
      "end_ms": 33502
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Sidi pulled up.",
      "start_ms": 33502,
      "end_ms": 34471
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "The bucket came back full of clear cool water.",
      "start_ms": 34471,
      "end_ms": 37319
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "He held it out.",
      "start_ms": 37319,
      "end_ms": 38288
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "She drank.",
      "start_ms": 38288,
      "end_ms": 38954
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "It was the best water she had ever tasted.",
      "start_ms": 38954,
      "end_ms": 41620
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "\"Two hundred years old, this well,\" Sidi said.",
      "start_ms": 41620,
      "end_ms": 44467
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "\"Maybe more.",
      "start_ms": 44467,
      "end_ms": 45255
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "The water is from very deep.",
      "start_ms": 45255,
      "end_ms": 47012
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "It has been safe from the surface heat and the surface dirt.",
      "start_ms": 47012,
      "end_ms": 50707
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "My great-grandfather brought me here when I was a child.",
      "start_ms": 50707,
      "end_ms": 54161
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "My great-great-grandfather brought him.",
      "start_ms": 54161,
      "end_ms": 56584
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "That is how far back it goes.\" He cleaned some sand out of the edges.",
      "start_ms": 56584,
      "end_ms": 60825
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "He checked the wood.",
      "start_ms": 60825,
      "end_ms": 62097
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "He replaced it.",
      "start_ms": 62097,
      "end_ms": 63066
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "He put the stones back.",
      "start_ms": 63066,
      "end_ms": 64520
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "He did all of it slowly and carefully.",
      "start_ms": 64520,
      "end_ms": 66883
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Nadia watched.",
      "start_ms": 66883,
      "end_ms": 67792
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "She thought about how many hands, over how many years, had done exactly this small piece of work at exactly this well.",
      "start_ms": 67792,
      "end_ms": 75061
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "They started back around eleven o'clock.",
      "start_ms": 75061,
      "end_ms": 77545
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "They had eaten a small meal of bread and dates.",
      "start_ms": 77545,
      "end_ms": 80453
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Farouk was rested.",
      "start_ms": 80453,
      "end_ms": 81604
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "The sun was high but the wind was very still.",
      "start_ms": 81604,
      "end_ms": 84391
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Sidi walked ahead.",
      "start_ms": 84391,
      "end_ms": 85542
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "They were maybe forty minutes into the return walk when Sidi stopped.",
      "start_ms": 85542,
      "end_ms": 89783
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "He climbed to the top of a small dune.",
      "start_ms": 89783,
      "end_ms": 92146
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "He looked off to the east.",
      "start_ms": 92146,
      "end_ms": 93781
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "He stayed there for a long moment.",
      "start_ms": 93781,
      "end_ms": 95902
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Then he came back down.",
      "start_ms": 95902,
      "end_ms": 97356
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "His face was different.",
      "start_ms": 97356,
      "end_ms": 98810
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Not scared.",
      "start_ms": 98810,
      "end_ms": 99537
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "But focused.",
      "start_ms": 99537,
      "end_ms": 100324
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "He said, \"Nadia.",
      "start_ms": 100324,
      "end_ms": 101354
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Come here.",
      "start_ms": 101354,
      "end_ms": 102021
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Look.\"",
      "start_ms": 102021,
      "end_ms": 102384
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "She climbed up to him.",
      "start_ms": 102384,
      "end_ms": 103816
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "She looked.",
      "start_ms": 103816,
      "end_ms": 104563
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Very far away, on the horizon in the direction they had come, there was a strange darkness.",
      "start_ms": 104563,
      "end_ms": 110289
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Not a cloud exactly.",
      "start_ms": 110289,
      "end_ms": 111597
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "A wall.",
      "start_ms": 111597,
      "end_ms": 112095
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "A low brown-orange wall stretching across the whole sky at that side.",
      "start_ms": 112095,
      "end_ms": 116452
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "The sky between the wall and them was still bright blue.",
      "start_ms": 116452,
      "end_ms": 120000
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "But the wall was there.",
      "start_ms": 120000,
      "end_ms": 121494
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "And she could see, even from this far, that it was moving.",
      "start_ms": 121494,
      "end_ms": 125166
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Slowly, but moving.",
      "start_ms": 125166,
      "end_ms": 126411
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Toward them.",
      "start_ms": 126411,
      "end_ms": 127283
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "\"Sandstorm,\" said Sidi.",
      "start_ms": 127283,
      "end_ms": 128777
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "He said it flatly.",
      "start_ms": 128777,
      "end_ms": 129959
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Not afraid.",
      "start_ms": 129959,
      "end_ms": 130706
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Just as a fact.",
      "start_ms": 130706,
      "end_ms": 131702
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "\"It will be here in — maybe forty minutes.",
      "start_ms": 131702,
      "end_ms": 134379
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Maybe less.",
      "start_ms": 134379,
      "end_ms": 135126
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "I did not see it before because it was behind the dunes.",
      "start_ms": 135126,
      "end_ms": 138674
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "It has come up fast.",
      "start_ms": 138674,
      "end_ms": 139981
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "This is a bad time of year for these.",
      "start_ms": 139981,
      "end_ms": 142346
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "I should have watched more carefully.\" He was already climbing down the dune.",
      "start_ms": 142346,
      "end_ms": 147202
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "\"Come.",
      "start_ms": 147202,
      "end_ms": 147637
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "We are going to walk fast now.\" Nadia climbed down.",
      "start_ms": 147637,
      "end_ms": 150874
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Her heart was beating hard.",
      "start_ms": 150874,
      "end_ms": 152617
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "\"We cannot outrun it,\" Sidi said, as they walked.",
      "start_ms": 152617,
      "end_ms": 155730
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "\"But there is a small shelter — a small mudbrick shelter — maybe two kilometers back the way we came.",
      "start_ms": 155730,
      "end_ms": 162079
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "It was built by nomads a long time ago.",
      "start_ms": 162079,
      "end_ms": 164569
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "If we can get there before the storm, we can go inside and wait.",
      "start_ms": 164569,
      "end_ms": 168615
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "If we cannot get there — then we have to stop, and we have to trust Farouk.",
      "start_ms": 168615,
      "end_ms": 173345
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Do you understand?\"",
      "start_ms": 173345,
      "end_ms": 174653
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "\"Yes,\" said Nadia.",
      "start_ms": 174653,
      "end_ms": 175835
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "She thought she understood.",
      "start_ms": 175835,
      "end_ms": 177578
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "She did not want to have to trust Farouk.",
      "start_ms": 177578,
      "end_ms": 180193
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "She wanted very much to reach the shelter.",
      "start_ms": 180193,
      "end_ms": 182931
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "They walked fast for maybe twenty minutes.",
      "start_ms": 182931,
      "end_ms": 185608
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Sidi led Farouk by the rope.",
      "start_ms": 185608,
      "end_ms": 187413
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Nadia was still on the camel — Sidi said she was safer up there.",
      "start_ms": 187413,
      "end_ms": 191459
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "She kept looking back.",
      "start_ms": 191459,
      "end_ms": 192891
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "The wall of dust was much closer now.",
      "start_ms": 192891,
      "end_ms": 195256
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "It was much higher — she could see, when she looked, that the top of it was above the highest dunes.",
      "start_ms": 195256,
      "end_ms": 201543
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "It was maybe a hundred meters high.",
      "start_ms": 201543,
      "end_ms": 203784
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "And it was coming.",
      "start_ms": 203784,
      "end_ms": 204967
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "She could see the shape of it changing as it moved, big rolling shapes tumbling forward like a slow-motion wave.",
      "start_ms": 204967,
      "end_ms": 212001
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "The wind was already starting to pick up.",
      "start_ms": 212001,
      "end_ms": 214615
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Small stinging bits of sand hit her hands.",
      "start_ms": 214615,
      "end_ms": 217292
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Her scarf whipped around her face.",
      "start_ms": 217292,
      "end_ms": 219408
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "\"Sidi,\" she called.",
      "start_ms": 219408,
      "end_ms": 220716
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "\"Sidi.",
      "start_ms": 220716,
      "end_ms": 221174
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "It is coming faster.\" \"Yes,\" he called back.",
      "start_ms": 221174,
      "end_ms": 224118
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "\"We are not going to make the shelter.",
      "start_ms": 224118,
      "end_ms": 226669
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Get down.",
      "start_ms": 226669,
      "end_ms": 227323
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Come.",
      "start_ms": 227323,
      "end_ms": 227716
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Get down.\" He helped her off Farouk.",
      "start_ms": 227716,
      "end_ms": 230136
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "He tied the goatskins to Nadia's back.",
      "start_ms": 230136,
      "end_ms": 232688
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "He put a rope around her wrist and tied the other end to his own wrist.",
      "start_ms": 232688,
      "end_ms": 237398
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "\"So we do not lose each other.",
      "start_ms": 237398,
      "end_ms": 239425
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "In the storm we cannot see even one meter.",
      "start_ms": 239425,
      "end_ms": 242238
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "If you are separated from me, I will not find you.\" He looked at Farouk.",
      "start_ms": 242238,
      "end_ms": 247014
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "He said something to the camel in a language Nadia did not know.",
      "start_ms": 247014,
      "end_ms": 251266
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Farouk lowered his head.",
      "start_ms": 251266,
      "end_ms": 252901
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "He touched his big soft nose to Nadia's forehead, once, gently.",
      "start_ms": 252901,
      "end_ms": 257088
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Then Sidi said, \"We follow him.",
      "start_ms": 257088,
      "end_ms": 259181
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Whatever he does.",
      "start_ms": 259181,
      "end_ms": 260359
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Wherever he goes.",
      "start_ms": 260359,
      "end_ms": 261536
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "We follow him.",
      "start_ms": 261536,
      "end_ms": 262518
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Trust the camel.",
      "start_ms": 262518,
      "end_ms": 263630
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Yes?\" Nadia said, \"Yes.\"",
      "start_ms": 263630,
      "end_ms": 265330
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Then the storm hit.",
      "start_ms": 265330,
      "end_ms": 266639
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "It was much worse than Nadia had imagined.",
      "start_ms": 266639,
      "end_ms": 269452
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "The world went brown-orange.",
      "start_ms": 269452,
      "end_ms": 271349
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "The wind was so loud she could not hear anything else — not Sidi, not Farouk, not her own breath.",
      "start_ms": 271349,
      "end_ms": 277760
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "The sand hit her exposed skin like small needles.",
      "start_ms": 277760,
      "end_ms": 281030
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Sidi pulled her close and pushed her down.",
      "start_ms": 281030,
      "end_ms": 283843
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Farouk had lowered himself to a sitting position with his legs folded, and Sidi pressed Nadia against Farouk's side, and then Sidi sat down against Farouk on the other side.",
      "start_ms": 283843,
      "end_ms": 295226
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Farouk's body was warm.",
      "start_ms": 295226,
      "end_ms": 296796
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "His fur was already covered in sand.",
      "start_ms": 296796,
      "end_ms": 299216
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "His enormous side was blocking most of the wind.",
      "start_ms": 299216,
      "end_ms": 302487
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "The storm lasted maybe twenty minutes.",
      "start_ms": 302487,
      "end_ms": 305038
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "It felt much longer.",
      "start_ms": 305038,
      "end_ms": 306412
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Nadia kept her eyes closed and her face pressed against Farouk's side and she held Sidi's hand very tightly through the storm.",
      "start_ms": 306412,
      "end_ms": 314720
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "She was crying, quietly, but she was not making sounds.",
      "start_ms": 314720,
      "end_ms": 318383
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "Sidi held her hand back.",
      "start_ms": 318383,
      "end_ms": 320019
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "He did not say anything either.",
      "start_ms": 320019,
      "end_ms": 322112
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "There was nothing to say.",
      "start_ms": 322112,
      "end_ms": 323813
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "The wind screamed.",
      "start_ms": 323813,
      "end_ms": 325056
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "The sand hissed.",
      "start_ms": 325056,
      "end_ms": 326168
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "And then — slowly — the wind began to drop.",
      "start_ms": 326168,
      "end_ms": 329046
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "The light began to come back.",
      "start_ms": 329046,
      "end_ms": 331009
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "And after a while it was just a normal sand-blown afternoon, and everything was orange and quiet and it was almost as if the storm had not happened, except for the sand piled up against them and Farouk.",
      "start_ms": 331009,
      "end_ms": 344288
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "They sat there for a while before they moved.",
      "start_ms": 344288,
      "end_ms": 347232
    }
  ]
}